{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……喂，新吾」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1771", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾那个样子没事吧？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1772", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总感觉，现在她朝这边看的眼神，\\n　就像是找不到主人的小狗一样哦？」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「总感觉，现在她朝这边看的眼神，　就像是找不到主人的小狗一样哦？」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1773", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4812", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一和我对上眼神，\\n脸就毫不犹豫地红了起来。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "纱凪一和我对上眼神，脸就毫不犹豫地红了起来。", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是禁断症状。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "交往越久，\\n在教室装作与我不熟就越痛苦。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "交往越久，在教室装作与我不熟就越痛苦。", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我来说也是一样的。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我经常在休息时间把纱凪带出教室，\\n去一些没什么人的地方。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "所以，我经常在休息时间把纱凪带出教室，去一些没什么人的地方。", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不仅是想要缓和纱凪的禁断症状\\n……同样我的忍耐也快到极限了。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "不仅是想要缓和纱凪的禁断症状……同样我的忍耐也快到极限了。", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一和纱凪接吻，纱凪就会变得站不起来，\\n但即便如此我们也是有掌握好限度的……", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "一和纱凪接吻，纱凪就会变得站不起来，但即便如此我们也是有掌握好限度的……", "plain_idx": 209, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说实话，我们两人可能都差不多要忍到极限了。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，那个“极限”的含义，\\n对于我和纱凪来说有点不同……但总而言之。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": "当然，那个“极限”的含义，对于我和纱凪来说有点不同……但总而言之。", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们可能需要采取点什么措施了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾那个样子，被大家察觉到也只是时间问题了」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1774", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说啊，你是怎么把小乾变成那样的啊？」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "「话说啊，你是怎么把小乾变成那样的啊？」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1775", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱的力量？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，摆出这么正经的脸说这种话吗」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1776", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是也是，交往的对象是你的话变成那样我也能理解」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1777", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾也是，选的对象太差了，害」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1778", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我们在教室角落小声议论的时候，\\n有几个女生一副想要说和我们什么似的，朝这边接近了过来。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "当我们在教室角落小声议论的时候，有几个女生一副想要说和我们什么似的，朝这边接近了过来。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，瓜生现在有空吗？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0010", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，我是不是回避一下更好？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1779", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，没事。毕竟是椋梨嘛」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0011", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，你这是什么意思？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1780", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘻嘻♪」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0012", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本以为是什么严肃的话题，但气氛却挺和缓。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像也不用那么紧张。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么是什么事呢？」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那个啊。瓜生，\\n　现在果然有正在交往的人吧？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「嗯，那个啊。瓜生，　现在果然有正在交往的人吧？」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0013", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我在之前休息的时候，那个……\\n　偶然看到你和一个头发很短的女生走在一起……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「我在之前休息的时候，那个……　偶然看到你和一个头发很短的女生走在一起……」", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0014", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「两人之间的氛围相当好，\\n　不是你朋友对吧？那个短头发的女生……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": "「两人之间的氛围相当好，　不是你朋友对吧？那个短头发的女生……」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0015", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎——假的吧！\\n　瓜生，你已经有交往的对象了吗？！」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「哎——假的吧！　瓜生，你已经有交往的对象了吗？！」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0002", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "各务台校男生Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂喂喂，不会吧瓜生～！\\n　是这个学校的人吗？哪个班的啊？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "「喂喂喂，不会吧瓜生～！　是这个学校的人吗？哪个班的啊？」", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_dc0001", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不是……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家跟着一起起哄，\\n现场的气氛可不允许我蒙混过关了。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "大家跟着一起起哄，现场的气氛可不允许我蒙混过关了。", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4813", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪也很担心地望向我这边。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那个，那是……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1781", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用了，隼太。谢谢你」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我制止了打算给我打掩护的隼太，\\n静静地和纱凪对上视线。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "我制止了打算给我打掩护的隼太，静静地和纱凪对上视线。", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4814", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在的我们无需言语。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我明白纱凪现在很不安。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是看到我一点头，纱凪也随即回应了我。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我挺起胸膛，走到了纱凪的身边。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然这种事并不值得宣扬」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4815", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我站在纱凪的身边，握住了她的手。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我和乾同学……和纱凪正在交往中」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "_GO_047", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室突然变得鸦雀无声，\\n所有人的视线都集中在我们两人身上。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "教室突然变得鸦雀无声，所有人的视线都集中在我们两人身上。", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪似乎是因为害怕，\\n握住我手的力度大到都让我觉得痛了。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "纱凪似乎是因为害怕，握住我手的力度大到都让我觉得痛了。", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太和濑名同学正在远处看着我们。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……瓜生，这不是也挺能干吗」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6605", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那家伙在该下决心的时候可不会犹豫哦」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1782", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「身为挚友，不为他鼓鼓掌吗？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6606", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔嗯，看上去没那必要」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1783", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……也是」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6607", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？！不是吧，是乾同学？！」\\n「什么——？！竟然是乾同学？！」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「哎？！不是吧，是乾同学？！」「什么——？！竟然是乾同学？！」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "_GO_048", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "骚动大到都快让整个教室晃起来了。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，这不是超般配的吗！」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0018", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的吗真的吗？！真好啊，纱凪真好啊——！」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0005", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "各务台校男生Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可恶，其实我的目标也是乾同学啊！\\n　要是瓜生成为对手，那根本赢不了啊——！」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「可恶，其实我的目标也是乾同学啊！　要是瓜生成为对手，那根本赢不了啊——！」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_dc0004", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……哎？哎？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4816", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对大家接二连三送上的祝福，\\n纱凪疑惑地看着我的脸。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "面对大家接二连三送上的祝福，纱凪疑惑地看着我的脸。", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，那个短发的女生原来是乾同学啊！\\n　那么可爱都吓了我一跳！」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": "「话说，那个短发的女生原来是乾同学啊！　那么可爱都吓了我一跳！」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0019", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说回来最近，纱凪也出落得更漂亮了呢」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0006", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "各务台校男生Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可恶可恶可恶，我看开了。\\n　瓜生，恭喜你啊！我，就当拿了个安慰奖吧！」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「可恶可恶可恶，我看开了。　瓜生，恭喜你啊！我，就当拿了个安慰奖吧！」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_dc0005", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
